[{"category":"section","location":"#MPIMagneticFields","page":"Home","text":"Documentation for MPIMagneticFields.\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields"},{"category":"constant","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.μ₀","page":"Home","text":"Vacuum magnetic permeability for usage within the field definitions\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.μ₀"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.AbstractFieldNode","page":"Home","text":"abstract type AbstractFieldNode\n\nAbstract supertype for evaluated nodes of magnetic fields.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.AbstractFieldNode"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.AbstractMagneticField","page":"Home","text":"abstract type AbstractMagneticField\n\nAbstract supertype for magnetic fields.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.AbstractMagneticField"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.AbstractNegativeField","page":"Home","text":"abstract type AbstractNegativeField <: AbstractMagneticField\n\nAbstract supertype for negative fields.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.AbstractNegativeField"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.AbstractSequencedField","page":"Home","text":"abstract type AbstractSequencedField <: AbstractMagneticField\n\nAbstract supertype for sequenced fields.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.AbstractSequencedField"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.AbstractSuperimposedField","page":"Home","text":"abstract type AbstractSuperimposedField <: AbstractMagneticField\n\nAbstract supertype for superimposed fields.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.AbstractSuperimposedField"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.FieldNode","page":"Home","text":"struct FieldNode{T, V} <: MPIMagneticFields.AbstractFieldNode\n\nEvaluated node of magnetic field.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.FieldNode"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.LimitedSequencedField","page":"Home","text":"struct LimitedSequencedField{SFT<:AbstractSequencedField, T<:Number} <: AbstractSequencedField\n\nContainer for limited sequenced fields.\n\nApplies field limits to a sequenced field.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.LimitedSequencedField"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.MotionPattern","page":"Home","text":"Abstract type for motion patterns describing e.g. rotations or translations.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.MotionPattern"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.MotionPatternSequence","page":"Home","text":"Abstract type for describing a sequence based on motion patterns.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.MotionPatternSequence"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.NegativeField","page":"Home","text":"struct NegativeField{T<:AbstractMagneticField} <: AbstractNegativeField\n\nContainer for negative fields.\n\nThe field of this container is interpreted as being the negative of field.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.NegativeField"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.NoRotationPattern","page":"Home","text":"Rotational movement pattern describing a non-existing movement.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.NoRotationPattern"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.NoTranslationPattern","page":"Home","text":"Translational movement pattern describing a non-existing movement.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.NoTranslationPattern"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.NoisyRotationPattern","page":"Home","text":"Rotational movement extending the StandardRotationPattern by a random deviation.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.NoisyRotationPattern"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.RotationPattern","page":"Home","text":"Abstract type describing rotational motions.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.RotationPattern"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.SawtoothTranslationPattern","page":"Home","text":"Translational movement pattern describing a sawtooth-like movement.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.SawtoothTranslationPattern"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.Sequence","page":"Home","text":"Abstract type for describing a sequence.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.Sequence"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.SequenceTemplate","page":"Home","text":"Abstract type for sequence templates which are a convenient way to construct sequences.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.SequenceTemplate"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.SequencedField","page":"Home","text":"struct SequencedField{FT<:AbstractMagneticField, ST<:Sequence} <: AbstractSequencedField\n\nContainer for sequenced fields.\n\nAttaches a sequence to a field defining the movement over time.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.SequencedField"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.SinusoidalTranslationPattern","page":"Home","text":"Translational movement pattern describing a sinusoidal movement.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.SinusoidalTranslationPattern"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.StandardRotationPattern","page":"Home","text":"Standard rotational movement defined by an angular frequency ω and a phase ϕ\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.StandardRotationPattern"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.StaticTranslationPattern","page":"Home","text":"Translational movement pattern describing a static movement.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.StaticTranslationPattern"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.SuperimposedField","page":"Home","text":"struct SuperimposedField{T<:AbstractMagneticField, U<:AbstractMagneticField} <: AbstractSuperimposedField\n\nContainer for superimposed fields.\n\nThe fields in fieldA and fieldB are interpreted as being linearily superimposed.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.SuperimposedField"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.TranslationPattern","page":"Home","text":"Abstract type describing translational motions.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.TranslationPattern"},{"category":"type","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.TriangleTranslationPattern","page":"Home","text":"Translational movement pattern describing a triangle-like movement.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.TriangleTranslationPattern"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.amplitude-Tuple{NoisyRotationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Amplitude of the rotation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.amplitude"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.amplitude-Tuple{SawtoothTranslationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Amplitude of the translation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.amplitude"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.amplitude-Tuple{SinusoidalTranslationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Amplitude of the translation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.amplitude"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.amplitude-Tuple{StandardRotationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Amplitude of the rotation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.amplitude"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.amplitude-Tuple{TriangleTranslationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Amplitude of the translation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.amplitude"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.fieldOverTime-Tuple{Sequence, AbstractMagneticField, Any, Any}","page":"Home","text":"Calculate the field for a given position r and at a given time point t\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.fieldOverTime"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.frequency-Tuple{NoisyRotationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Frequency of the rotation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.frequency"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.frequency-Tuple{SawtoothTranslationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Frequency of the translation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.frequency"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.frequency-Tuple{SinusoidalTranslationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Frequency of the translation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.frequency"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.frequency-Tuple{StandardRotationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Frequency of the rotation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.frequency"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.frequency-Tuple{TriangleTranslationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Frequency of the translation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.frequency"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.motionAtTime-Tuple{MotionPattern, Any}","page":"Home","text":"Calculate the state of the motion at a given time point t\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.motionAtTime"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.nodes-Tuple{AbstractMagneticField, Vararg{Any}}","page":"Home","text":"nodes(field, args; kwargs...)\n\n\nEvaluate field at given position and return it together with the position.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.nodes"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.offset-Tuple{NoisyRotationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Offset of the rotation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.offset"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.offset-Tuple{SawtoothTranslationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Offset of the translation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.offset"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.offset-Tuple{SinusoidalTranslationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Offset of the translation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.offset"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.offset-Tuple{StandardRotationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Offset of the rotation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.offset"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.offset-Tuple{TriangleTranslationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Offset of the translation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.offset"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.phase-Tuple{NoisyRotationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Phase of the rotation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.phase"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.phase-Tuple{SawtoothTranslationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Phase of the translation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.phase"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.phase-Tuple{SinusoidalTranslationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Phase of the translation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.phase"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.phase-Tuple{StandardRotationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Phase of the rotation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.phase"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.phase-Tuple{TriangleTranslationPattern}","page":"Home","text":"Phase of the translation pattern.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.phase"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.rotation-Tuple{MotionPatternSequence}","page":"Home","text":"Rotation pattern of the sequence\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.rotation"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.sequence-Tuple{SequenceTemplate}","page":"Home","text":"Convert a sequence template to a regular sequence\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.sequence"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.totalSequenceTime-Tuple{Sequence}","page":"Home","text":"Total trajectory duration\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.totalSequenceTime"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.translation-Tuple{MotionPatternSequence}","page":"Home","text":"Translation pattern of the sequence\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.translation"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.value-Tuple{AbstractMagneticField, Vararg{Any}}","page":"Home","text":"value(field, args; kwargs...)\n\n\nRetrieve the value of a magnetic field.\n\nThe order of arguments varies depending on the traits of the actual type.\n\nWith a time varying field, the first argument is the time t.\n\nOtherwise the position r is the first parameter.\n\nThe rotation angle ϕ is the next parameter if the field is rotatable,\n\notherwise it is the shift vektor δ.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.value"},{"category":"method","location":"#MPIMagneticFields.value_-Tuple{AbstractMagneticField, Vararg{Any}}","page":"Home","text":"value_(field, args; kargs...)\n\n\nRetrieve the value of a magnetic field.\n\nThe order of arguments varies depending on the traits of the actual type. With a time varying field, the first argument is the time t. Otherwise the position r is the first parameter. The rotation angle ϕ is the next parameter if the field is rotatable, otherwise it is the shift vektor δ. Note: The underscore is important!\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"MPIMagneticFields.value_"}]
